\par\par \b \uc2  Peru's Sol Ends Unchanged In Thin Pre-Holiday Session \b0\par\par\uc2 246 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Dezember 1999\par 20:14\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  LIMA -(Dow Jones)- Peru's nuevo sol (PEN) closed unchanged Thursday in a quiet session before the end-of-the-year holiday, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The nuevo sol closed at a midrate of 3.5080 per dollar on a spread of PEN3.5070 to PEN3.5090, local traders said, unchanged from Wednesday's close. \par \par \uc2  "The sol closed unchanged as few investors joined in the trading due to the year-end holidays," said a trader at Banco de Credito. \par \par \uc2  The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \uc2  The key overnight lending rate was around 21%, traders said, higher than Wednesday's official closing at 20.6%. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets will be open in Lima Friday. \par \par \uc2  As of Dec. 29 the outstanding value of CDs, used by the government to control the money supply and influence the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , was PEN399 million, lower than the PEN449 million the day prior. \par \par \uc2  The amount of the outstanding CDs has fallen recently because banks have been holding higher stocks of local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , an official at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said. \par \par \uc2  Demand for \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  normally increases at year's end, and banks have been holding even more than normal this year due to expected demand for cash due to Y2K jitters. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  expects that tendency to be reversed after the new\par year arrives.\par -Virginia Rey-Sanchez; Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050;\par peru@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1071 1837 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dvcu08mjt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
