\par\par \b \uc2  Peru Plans Inflation-Linked Sol Bonds; Mulls Dlr Issue \b0\par\par\uc2 259 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Mai 1999\par 23:22\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru plans to issue inflation-linked bonds denominated in soles within the next few weeks, the chief advisor at the finance ministry said Friday. \par \par \uc2  The issue will be worth 700 million nuevos soles (PEN) ($1=PEN3.3374), and is expected to take place within the next 50 days, the official, Carlos Paredes, said in a speech. \par \par \uc2  The borrower will be Cofide, the government's wholesale lending agency, which channels funds through commercial banks. \par \par \uc2  "This will permit the creation of long-term credits in soles," Paredes said. \par \par \uc2  He later told reporters that officials expect good demand for the bonds with institutional investors such as private pension funds and life insurance companies as well as with the general public. \par \par \uc2  He declined to provide any details about the issue like maturity, referring questions to Cofide. No Cofide spokesperson was immediately available. \par \par \uc2  Peru has also been considering floating a different bond denominated in U.S. dollars in international capital markets, in part to help build a benchmark for local corporate borrowers. \par \par \uc2  The government has also been working to increase liquidity in local markets in order to help Peruvian businesses. \par \par \uc2  Paredes also reaffirmed that Peru will continue with its floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime, and that the Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue its policy of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to soften abrupt movements of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  when needed. \par \par \uc2  "The exchange rate will float and there will be \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  when needed to avoid speculation," said Paredes. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 21-05-99 \par \par \uc2  2122GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv5l03vs8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
