\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Peru \highlight\uc2 's Sol Ends Stronger;  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervenes \highlight\uc2  Again \b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 22:55\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  LIMA (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2 's nuevo sol finished stronger Wednesday, shrugging off heavy \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  aimed at slowing appreciation of the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , local traders said. \par \par \uc2  The nuevo sol ended trading at a midrate of PEN3.3335 per dollar on a spread of PEN3.3318 to PEN3.3352 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  That was stronger than Tuesday's close of PEN3.3368 on a spread of PEN3.3350 to PEN3.3386 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  Local banks were buying soles before the long Easter weekend, when demand for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  normally increases. \par \par \uc2  The Central Reserve Bank of Peru bought $18.1 million, local traders said. \par \par \uc2  "Banks were selling dollars because they needed soles for the long weekend and ahead of their normal demand for soles at the end of the month," said a trader at Banco Wiese. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also in the market Tuesday, buying $2.0 million. Prior to that, the last time the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought dollars was Oct. 23, when it purchased $3.6 million. \par \par \uc2  The key overnight lending rate was around 26.0%, higher than Tuesday's official closing figure of 15.4%. \par \par \uc2  In the informal market, the dollar traded at PEN3.345, compared with PEN3.35 Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  As of March 29, the outstanding value of CDs, used by the government to control the money supply and influence the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , was PEN127.9 million. \par \par \uc2  -By Virginia Rey-Sanchez; 511-221-7050; VReySanchez@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 31-03-99 \par \par \uc2  2055GMT \par \par \uc2  1071 1837 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv3v02i2t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
