\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Peru \highlight\uc2 's Sol Ends Stronger Despite  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 22:00\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  LIMA (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2 's nuevo sol finished stronger Tuesday, despite a $2 million purchase by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  aimed at keeping the sol from strengthening even more, local traders said. \par \par \uc2  The nuevo sol ended trading at a mid-rate of PEN/3.3368 per dollar on a spread of PEN3.3350-3.3386/dollar. \par \par \uc2  That was stronger than Monday's close at PEN3.3537 on a spread of PEN3.3518-PEN3.3556. \par \par \uc2  "Some banks were selling dollars as there was an ample supply of soles, and there were few worries about the future of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said a trader at Banco Wiese. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen buying $2.0 million against Peru's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , aiming to avoid a steeper rise in the value of the sol. \par \par \uc2  The last time the Central Reserve Bank of Peru bought dollars was on October 23, when it purchased $3.6 million. \par \par \uc2  The sol has been strengthening this week on strong demand before the Easter holidays, when spending usually increases. \par \par \uc2  The key overnight lending rate was around 15%, higher than Monday's official closing figure of 14.6%. \par \par \uc2  In the informal market, the dollar traded at PEN3.35, unchanged from Monday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par As of March 29, the outstanding value of CDs, used by the government\par to control the money supply and influence the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , was PEN127.9\par million.\par -By Virginia Rey-Sanchez;511-221-7050;VReySanchez@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 30-03-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2000GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1071 1837 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv3u02geq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
