\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Peru \highlight\uc2  Sol Ends -2: Last Ctrl Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Feb. 4 \b0\par\par\uc2 238 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 1999\par 23:43\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's move took place after contradictory comments on \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy by government officials. \par \par \uc2  Early Thursday officials at the Finance ministry told banks in a closed-door meeting that \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would not take any steps to prevent a further weakening of the sol. \par \par \uc2  But late Thursday, President Alberto Fujimori said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to defend the sol. His remarks came after he met with officials at the Finance ministry, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the Superintendency of Banking and Insurance. \par \par \uc2  A Finance ministry source said that if the sol devaluates, speculations on possible depreciations will likely disappear and banks won't have reasons to increase interest rates. \par \par \uc2  The key interest rate was around 27.0%, higher than Thursday's 25.1%. \par \par \uc2  A government's source familiar with the latest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  said that ministry's idea comes from Harvard economist Jeffrey Sachs's worries over Peru's high interest rates. \par \par \uc2  Sachs, who has been advising Peru's government, held his first meeting in Lima with officials on Monday. \par \par \uc2  In the informal market, the sol traded at PEN3.44, compared with PEN3.48 to the dollar Thursday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  had sol $