\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Peru Central Bank \highlight\uc2 /Sell/Dollars -3: Last  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Feb. 4 \b0\par\par\uc2 236 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 1999\par 19:49\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The latest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  comes after contradictory statements about ongoing \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy from government officials this week. \par \par \uc2  On Thursday, a source at the finance ministry confirmed traders version that an official at the ministry told local banks in a closed-door meeting that the government would not take steps to prevent the further weakening of the sol. \par \par \uc2  But late Thursday, President Alberto Fujimori said that \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may continue \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the foreign market to prevent abrupt \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swings. \par \par \uc2  A Finance Ministry official, who asked not be named, said Friday that although "the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't have to stop the weakening of the sol," it must "\b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  firmly in cases of speculative movements." \par \par \uc2  Finance minister officials have said that the 6% sol's depreciation in January was expected by government because of lower capital inflows. \par \par \uc2  They also have said that depreciation will help Peru's exports and protect local industry from imports. \par \par \uc2  Economist Cesar Cabrera told radio station Radio Programas that the government is pleased with the sol's depreciation, but said this does not mean the bank will not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in cases of speculative attacks. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  had sold about $20 million on Feb. 3, and $9 million\par on Feb. 4.\par -By Virginia Rey-Sanchez; 511-221-7050; VReySanchez@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 26-02-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1849GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2q01j98\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
