\par\par \b \uc2  Peru Fin Min Confirms Ctrl Bk Sold $10.5M Wed \b0\par\par\uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Januar 1999\par 16:39\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  LIMA (Dow Jones)--The Peruvian government has announced a series of measures in response to the crisis in Brazil that it says will shield Peru's economy. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Victor Joy Way said in a press release late Wednesday that Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2  is prepared to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  In an interview with radio station Radioprogramas Thursday, Joy Way confirmed that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold $10.5 million Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The press release also said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is prepared to cut the minimum reserve requirement for dollar-denominated deposits. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been reducing the minimum reserve requirement since July, when it was 45%. The minimum reserve requirement now is 39% for existing dollar-denominated deposits and 20% for new dollar-denominated deposits. \par \par \uc2  The Finance Ministry said the government will use $200 million of a $547 million loan given by Inter-American Development Bank to inject liquidity in the banking system. It didn't specify when the loan could be used. \par \par \uc2  The press release said that Peru is negotiating with the World Bank and IDB for loans to strengthen its foreign reserves. Peru is seeking $500 million from each bank. It is also negotiating a loan from Japan's Export-Import Bank for $300 million. \par \par \uc2  The Finance Ministry said that Peru will sell $600 million of pending state shares in companies already privatized. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires  14-01-99 \par \par \uc2  1539GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010827dv1e000lx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
