es already privatized. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 14-01-99 \par \par \uc2  1534GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv1e00bpi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
