\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Peru \highlight\uc2  sol weakens on  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 234 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Dezember 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  LIMA, Dec 22 (Reuter)- The Peruvian sol weakened slightly on the interbank market to 2.299/2.309 soles to the dollar after opening at 2.298/2.308 on \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The government's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came after the sol had gained strength against the dollar over several weeks due to seasonal factors. At bank counters, the sol ended flat at 2.280/2.340 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The parallel market saw the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strengthen slightly to close at 2.314/2.316 soles after starting the session at 2.315/2.320 soles, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  According to banking sources, the supply of dollars was high in the morning causing the sol to strengthen until the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars, stabilizing the sol's value. \par \par \uc2  "After the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the financial system saw demand on certain speculation," one dealer said. "This caused the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's (dollar) price to rise." \par \par \uc2  Nonetheless, the market showed little liquidity in soles so, if the bank does not turn around and sell soles, the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to continue firm as the banks still have obligations to meet, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Banking sources said the sol is expected to resume its rise against the dollar unless the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  again. \par \par \uc2  -- Lima newsroom 511 221-2134 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103drcm00bcd\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (Peru near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 